WEBVTT

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:03.330
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:06.320
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.400
I will now announce the results of the elimination audition.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.160
The final member of Tristar will be...

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.530
Shibuki Ran!

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.040
It went exactly as you planned.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:25.460
Yes, Tristar's stadium live gathered more attention than I could have ever hoped for.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.040
But this is only the beginning.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:33.220
To ensure the continued success of Starlight Academy,

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.300
I will make one more unit.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:37.470
Are you talking about...

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:21.660
I wonder what important announcement the headmistress is going to make?

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:24.500
Don't you think it'll be about Tristar?

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:28.030
News about Tristar is spreading around the globe like wildfire.

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:30.170
I bet it'll be a happy announcement.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:34.230
Yeah, like them making a Hollywood debut or something?

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:35.170
I can see it happening.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.890
I can see it too!

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:38.680
I can't not see it not happening. {Unsee means something different. Also, she uses one too many negatives...}{I know}

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:40.580
So you <i>can</i> see it!

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:47.680
Good morning! Good to see you all, honeys.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:51.190
Now then, it's showtime!

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:58.440
I'm truly grateful that you all found the time to gather here on such short notice.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:03.200
Thanks to you, Kanzaki Mizuki's unit, Tristar,

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.450
is spreading its wings across the world.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:11.460
However, we at Starlight Academy feel that it is appropriate to set one more new unit upon the scene.

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:13.140
A new unit?

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.710
The members have already been decided.

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:18.930
Who is it?

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:19.970
Who could it be...

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.470
It's finally time for me to shine.

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.060
I'm so excited!

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:24.720
Me too.

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:27.220
Please prepare yourselves.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:29.520
The new unit's members are...

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:35.160
Hoshimiya Ichigo and Kiriya Aoi.

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:38.010
Aoi...

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:39.090
Ichigo...

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.240
M-Mom! Come quick! {Mom?} {I think we've been using "Mom"}

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:51.220
Onee-chan and Aoi-neesan are—!

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:53.340
Yeah, I heard from over here.

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:57.170
Thanks for the wonderful news, Orihime.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:04:01.670
Please enjoy the growth and development of this fresh new unit.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:05.750
I can't believe we get to be in a unit together!

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:08.180
I'm so amazingly happy!

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:11.650
Ichigo-sama, Aoi-sama, congratulations.

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:13.540
Love you!

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:17.440
Don't expect me not to cheer for you every night from my coffin.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:18.820
Thanks, everyone.

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:20.440
Thank you.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.900
There they are!

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:24.700
Ichigo-chan, Aoi-chan!

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.060
May we get a few comments?

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:28.640
Ichigo-chan, how do you feel right now?

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:30.320
U-Um... {consistency}

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.210
I'm happy.

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:35.760
I'm so happy that I want to run around the school right now.

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:38.710
How about you, Aoi-chan?

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:39.710
Ah, right!

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:42.090
It really surprised me since it came out of nowhere,

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:47.220
but I've never been as happy as I am now that I have the opportunity to form a unit with Ichigo.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.220
I'll do anything to succeed!

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:56.230
Mizuki-san.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:59.230
Take a look. A new unit has been born. {I can feel someone yelling at us for not putting two spaces between sentences}

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:02.240
All of this stuff about forming a unit still feels like a dream.

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:03.970
Ichigo and Aoi?

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:04.740
That's right.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:07.090
Oh, fantastic!

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:09.370
A powerful new rival has appeared!

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.120
I can't wait to see them in action.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.960
Thank you for your time.

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:16.900
You did it, Ichigo, Aoi.

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:24.010
The two of you have no time to be surprised.

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:27.640
Every second of an idol's life must be put to good use.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:28.990
Yes!

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:31.370
Let's get to it, Starmiya and Kiriya.

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:35.140
This is your time schedule starting tonight!

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.720
Every single minute's taken care of.

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:38.650
Of course.

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:41.650
You'll be just as busy as Tristar from now on. {am I using 'now' too much?} {I think it's fine}

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.340
As busy as Tristar?

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:44.420
Wow.

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.650
Here is your first assignment.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:49.620
Decide what your unit name will be.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:52.450
Choose a name that belongs to nobody other than yourselves. {cirque du...}

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:55.310
This will be the first step of your journey.

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:56.410
Good luck!

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:57.620
Got it!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.540
Please excuse us.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:05.380
Things are really starting to heat up.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:08.340
Those two won't follow the rails laid out for them.

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:12.190
By choosing their own name and goals, they will forge their own path to their dreams.

00:06:12.190 --> 00:06:15.430
It was always my dream to create an idol like that.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:20.440
I'm sure we can count on Starmiya's airhead power and Kiriya's producing abilities to do them well. {When I first watched it, I interpreted "tennen power" as "natural talent", but I guess this works too...}

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:21.940
That's right.

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:23.190
Amazing.

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:24.930
Amazing, amazing!

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:27.960
Did you forget how to say anything other than "amazing"?

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:29.820
But it's just so amazing!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:33.270
I'm so amazingly happy that we get to be in a unit together!

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:36.380
Me too! Looks like we'll be busy, but we can do it.

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:38.330
Yeah! Let's go!

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:41.210
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:44.680
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:01.480
It says "bedtime" on our schedule, but still...

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:02.980
I just can't sleep!

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:06.350
We still haven't thought up a unit name either.

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:08.460
Ichigo, what do you think?

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:10.450
I dunno...

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.240
I'm fine with whatever you choose!

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:15.240
Hey, does that mean you're making me do all the hard work?

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:18.250
I know I'll like anything you come up with.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:20.500
I can't back down after hearing that!

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:30.010
I wonder if Ran's heard about our unit yet.

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:34.340
Yeah, she's probably already cheering us on in her heart.

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:35.510
I'm sure of it.

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:39.760
I want to text her, but she's probably too busy to reply.

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:43.070
Ran's probably giving it everything she's got right now.

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:45.720
Let's pray for her success like usual.

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:47.020
Let's.

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:51.780
Nothing yet...

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:55.280
I expected them to tell me about it right away.

00:07:57.580 --> 00:07:59.700
Oh well, guess they're busy too...

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:05.080
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:07.570
Ran-san, please go on standby.

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:09.290
Ah, coming!

00:08:12.390 --> 00:08:14.050
Good job out there.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:15.830
Thank you very much.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:18.690
Good work.

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:25.760
<i>Dear Ran, we came up with a unit name!</i>

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:27.950
<i>Before we announce it,</i>

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:30.840
<i>we wanted to make sure you were the first to hear.</i>

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:33.150
<i>And that name is... Soleil!</i>

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:34.350
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:39.150
<i>I give my seal of approval.</i>

00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:41.140
<i>It's the perfect name for you two.</i>

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:44.700
"You two"...

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:59.720
Work it, great! I expect no less from Tristar!

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.190
We're going straight to TKY TV after this. {to avoid two heads}

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:06.990
We'll head to Osaka as soon as our music show ends.

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:08.110
I understand.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:10.160
Great! Osaka!

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:13.240
I've always wanted to go! Tristar rules!

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:16.860
Ran, you okay?

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.740
I-I'm fine.

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:25.250
Am I just hallucinating that look on your face then? {I kind of want to change it, but I guess it's fine}

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.930
Let's eat a ton of delicious food in Osaka.

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:34.720
Sure.

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:40.010
Have you memorized today's schedule yet?

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:43.340
Yes. First we have a meeting here for our commercial,

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:45.110
followed by moving to TKY TV.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:48.020
At 1pm we have our rehearsal for our music show. {after staring at 1PM, 1pm, 1 p.m., 1 PM, etc. I just don't know what's best anymore... internet seems to prefer lower case in all situation though}

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:49.160
Good job.

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:51.250
Are you ready for this?

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:54.900
No matter what challenges you face, you must combine your strengths to overcome them!

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.400
We will.

00:09:57.080 --> 00:10:00.890
I feel like I've been hearing people say "you two" to me a lot recently.

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:03.590
It's so different from when Ran was with us.

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:09.670
I was truly happy for Ran when they 
announced that she would join Tristar,

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:12.110
but now, that's not all I feel.

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:16.050
We really have started walking down different paths.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:16.960
Yeah.

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:44.070
Ran.

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:44.820
Yes?

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:47.280
I just got some info from Tsukikage-san.

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:50.880
It seems that Hoshimiya and Kiriya are here today for a rehearsal.

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:56.920
I also heard that they're holding their first concert tomorrow. {I want to use "live" so badly...} {it can be helped in this case, so gaman shite}

00:10:57.290 --> 00:11:01.520
If we finish our work quickly, you might just barely be able to see them.

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:03.270
Why don't you go congratulate them? {ｶﾂ入れにいってあげたら？} {カツ入れ means to encourage/pump up (also, it's katsu as in Aikatsu); I think this is fine, but you can change it}

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:04.140
I will.

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:08.630
Please come over to the makeup room.

00:11:08.630 --> 00:11:09.940
Coming.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.610
<i>Ichigo, Aoi...</i>

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:17.070
<i>Please let me make it in time.</i>

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:21.070
We're about to enter the final shoot.

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:37.770
<i>I made a mistake...</i>

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:41.090
I'm really sorry about what happened.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:43.310
It's not like you to make a mistake.

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:46.050
Ran, don't mind it.

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:47.180
C'mon, let's go.

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:48.600
I'm truly sorry.

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:53.600
There might still be time.

00:11:57.050 --> 00:11:59.050
<i>Ichigo, Aoi!</i>

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.390
Ran-san, perfect timing.

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:09.360
Yes?

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:12.750
Ichigo-chan and Aoi-chan left this for you.

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:14.910
Thank you.

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.370
It's stamina juice!

00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:22.330
We know you're really busy, so do your best!

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:27.320
Gross!

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.270
I bet I know what happened.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:33.230
First is garlic, and then some spinach!

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:36.120
Don't forget to finish with a squeeze of lemon.

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:39.390
Ran's probably running around all day, so we need to help keep her stamina up.

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:43.280
I don't disagree, but if you mix all that together don't you think it'll taste awful?

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.280
Finished!

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:48.280
See?

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.790
I could see them doing that.

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:07.630
Sorry I'm late!

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:10.710
Hurry up, we're already half an hour late.

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:11.930
Okay!

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:16.740
Mizuki, what's wrong?

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:17.440
Nothing.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:24.190
Um, I'm really sorry about my mistake today.

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.940
You don't have to apologize.

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:30.950
It's not like you're doing this for me, right?

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:36.340
<i>Mizuki-san was right... {zwei betten?}</i>

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:38.210
<i>I wonder when it started?</i>

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:41.210
<i>I wasn't like this before...</i>

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:47.970
Yes?

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:49.530
Hey, Mizuki!

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:53.520
Let's get some of Osaka's specialties, takoyaki and okonamiyaki!

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:55.480
Sounds good, let's do it.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.980
Yay! I'll go get Ran then!

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.310
Hold on, Kaede.

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:03.760
Knowing Ran, I'm sure she'd come if we ask,

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:05.740
but I don't think we should bother her now.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:09.040
I made a mistake.

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:16.800
"Do your best", huh...

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:18.770
It wasn't that long ago

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:21.750
that we were joining hands and saying "let's do our best"...

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.250
I miss them...

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:27.260
I want to see Ichigo and Aoi.

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:32.410
But tomorrow's their first concert...

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:36.620
Mizuki-san?

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:52.280
Ichigo-chan, Aoi-chan, let me begin by congratulating you on your new unit.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:54.110
Thank you very much!

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:56.540
How confident are you about today's concert?

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:59.190
I'd say... not at all.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:03.430
B-But I think I'll be able to put on my best performance!

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:06.810
Aoi's here with me, after all.

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:08.920
Me too.

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.430
When I'm with Ichigo, I'm not afraid of anything!

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:13.100
How nice.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:15.040
So what will your unit be called?

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:17.100
The two of you thought it up together, right?

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:19.550
Right! We talked about it with each other.

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:21.600
But it was the three of us who decided.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:22.810
Three of you?

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:23.360
Yes!

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:25.810
Although we can't do our activities together,

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:29.240
our hearts are always connected with our other best friend.

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:32.990
I just know that she's supporting us today no matter where she is.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:36.490
Even when we're apart, the sky above us always keeps us connected.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:37.470
Yeah!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.770
It's finally time for the awaited unit name to be revealed.

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:43.630
We're ready.

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:46.890
With the feelings of being embraced by the warm and gentle sun...

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:49.260
We're Soleil!

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:52.260
Soleil! What a wonderful name.

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:54.130
Thank you very much.

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.150
Ran!{they're so fucking pittari right now}

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:12.330
Isn't that Shibuki Ran... from Tristar?

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:13.160
You're right!

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:14.700
What's happening?!

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.930
It's just like you said.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:19.160
Things are really starting to heat up.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.470
What happened?

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:22.020
Why are you here?

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:23.170
I...

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:25.670
I quit Tristar.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.380
You left Tristar?!

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:34.350
I know this is sudden, but please allow me to make an important announcement here.

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:36.450
I, Shibuki Ran,

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:38.390
have dropped out of Tristar.

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:45.440
It's because we're together that I can run my hardest.

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:46.700
Ran...

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:47.940
Ran!

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:50.620
Ran-chan, are you really serious?

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:52.860
What about your Hollywood debut?

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:56.430
Doesn't Tristar have a concert at Osaka Dome today?

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:02.950
Right about now, Ran is standing in brilliant sunlight,

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:05.210
at the place she can shine the brightest.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:09.790
Kaede and I are going to support Ran with all of our hearts.

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:11.130
Yes!

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:14.980
Then let's head right into the next song!

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:16.220
Our next song is...

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.260
Welcome back!

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:21.220
Glad to be here.

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:25.190
Headmistress, was this in your calculations as well?

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:26.750
No way...

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:29.890
But they're forging their own paths by themselves.

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:31.110
Isn't it a beautiful thing?

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:33.740
Yes!!

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:38.020
And without any delay, it's time for our performance!

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:38.910
You ready?

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:41.870
Yeah, I've already beat the dance deep into my head. {I... guess.}

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:39.250
They pulled off their Special Appeal!

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:42.800
Triangle Sunny Light! Love you!

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:45.820
As expected of Ichigo-sama, Aoi-sama, and Ran-sama.

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:47.760
It's left me breathless.

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:49.070
Great!

00:20:49.070 --> 00:20:51.770
Mizuki, are you okay with not seeing Ran's concert?

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:53.560
I already know how it went.

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:56.030
Without a doubt, Ran was shining.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:00.040
That felt great!

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:02.540
Yeah! Ran, thanks for making it.

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:03.610
Thank you.

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:05.140
Same here.

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:07.040
<i>Mizuki-san.</i>

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:10.300
<i>I stood on stage as a member of Soleil.</i>

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:14.160
<i>Dear Ran, I've decided.</i>

00:21:14.510 --> 00:21:17.670
<i>I don't want to rain on your heart any longer.</i>

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:21.530
<i>I'm removing you from Tristar.</i>

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:25.790
<i>You deserve to be able to shine under the sun.</i>

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:29.360
<i>I nearly tossed your dream aside to accomplish my own. {how did that even}</i>

00:21:29.360 --> 00:21:30.180
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:21:31.070 --> 00:21:33.930
<i>I'll always be watching you from the night sky.</i>

00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:36.370
<i>Even if our paths differ,</i>

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:38.840
<i>let's both shine together in the same sky.</i>

00:21:38.840 --> 00:21:39.940
<i>Mizuki.</i>

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:42.620
Mizuki-san...

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:50.660
Ran...

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:55.460
Let's all work together so we can outshine even Mizuki-san!

00:21:57.090 --> 00:21:58.080
Let's!

00:21:59.680 --> 00:22:03.170
From now on, the three of us will always shine together.

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:04.320
Right!

00:22:04.940 --> 00:22:06.410
Let's do our best!

00:22:06.410 --> 00:22:07.740
Together!

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:11.350
<i>Not "do your best",</i>

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:13.080
<i>but "do our best"!</i>

00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:15.600
<i>Those are the words I wanted to hear...</i>

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:17.700
All together!

00:22:17.700 --> 00:22:19.460
Yeah!

00:23:55.680 --> 00:23:57.740
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.860 --> 00:24:01.580
Our new unit's finally debuted!

00:24:01.580 --> 00:24:04.480
Yeah, and we're unstoppable now that we've got Ran.

00:24:04.480 --> 00:24:07.380
Right! Let's have a lot of fun!

00:24:08.120 --> 00:24:09.880
Three's a Soleil! {you can change this back if you want}

00:24:10.920 --> 00:24:12.800
From now on Soleil is a three-person unit.

00:24:12.800 --> 00:24:14.050
Yeah, let's do this.

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:17.350
But now that we're up a girl, we need a leader.

00:24:17.350 --> 00:24:18.180
A leader?

00:24:18.530 --> 00:24:20.070
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:20.070 --> 00:24:21.440
Strawberry Parfait.

00:24:21.440 --> 00:24:25.770
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
